{"id": "45cbec51dc8da735040f5d87c188eef6", "text": "A living being cannot perform activities independently or get \nactivities performed by others nor achieve fruits from such actions nor get \nfruits for others independently. The ever -independent Lord is responsible \nfor all these actions. (5.14)  \n \nLiving beings cannot independently diminish sins nor claim credit \nfor good deeds. Their knowledge is veiled  by ignorance , and hence they are \ndeluded . Being deluded , they cannot realize the Lord. (5.15)", "embedding": [0.04853755235671997, 0.008919415064156055, -0.01945563405752182, 0.025603823363780975, 0.06849344819784164, 0.02724665030837059, 0.06441604346036911, -0.0942879468202591, 0.04638113081455231, 0.05240783467888832, 0.08426032215356827, -0.043796297162771225, 0.03624245151877403, -0.03987976908683777, 0.0381958931684494, -0.05999410152435303, -0.12679961323738098, -0.026910552754998207, -0.07773140072822571, -0.014712692238390446, 0.028560666367411613, 0.04242389649152756, -0.042804453521966934, -0.014763753861188889, 0.02838236279785633, -0.030325889587402344, 0.047090381383895874, -0.08478544652462006, 0.022102029994130135, -0.07561631500720978, 0.04685050994157791, -0.0728214755654335, 0.030862094834446907, -0.02266770787537098, -0.08792486041784286, 0.05256756395101547, 0.031122742220759392, 0.02122211456298828, -0.028929265215992928, -0.05026192218065262, 0.03266700729727745, 0.06473734229803085, -0.08136329799890518, -0.043150097131729126, -0.03151755779981613, -0.04825293645262718, -0.0738602876663208, -0.0005518228863365948, -0.012726817280054092, -0.07818344235420227, -0.09385592490434647, -0.017049264162778854, 0.05505600944161415, -0.03275131806731224, -0.07141014188528061, 0.04866821691393852, -0.1024063229560852, -0.010411025024950504, 0.020458336919546127, -0.029928522184491158, 0.03173231706023216, -0.008778776973485947, 0.08547024428844452, -0.009400321170687675, 0.052971165627241135, 0.050304386764764786, 0.022455180063843727, -0